OL,3,GNEWSARevamp plans for 250-year-old     
OL,4,Amarket submitted                       
OL,6,FPlans to regenerate a 250-year-old     
OL,7,Fmarket in the centre of Oxford have    
OL,8,Fbeen submitted by a local authority.   
OL,10,FOxford City Council said its #8m       
OL,11,Fproposals to redevelop the city's      
OL,12,FCovered Market would help secure the   
OL,13,Ffuture of the much-loved historic      
OL,14,Fshopping centre.                       
OL,16,FIt previously said the works would     
OL,17,F"deliver essential upgrades... while   
OL,18,Frespecting the unique history, charm,  
OL,19,Fand legacy" of the site.               
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
