OL,3,GNEWSARevamp plans for 250-year-old     
OL,4,Amarket submitted                       
OL,6,FHaving lodged an application with its  
OL,7,Fplanning department, the council said  
OL,8,Fit would look to employ a contractor   
OL,9,Ffor the scheme in 2027, with the aim of
OL,10,Fconstruction beginning in 2028.        
